      "revision": 106365404,
      "text": "セイロンマンリョウ は、ヤブコウジ科に分類される植物の一種。別名ウミベマンリョウ、コウトウタチバナ。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Ardisia elliptica」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ardisia_elliptica",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1309053036,
      "text": "Ardisia elliptica is an evergreen tree, also known as the shoebutton ardisia, duck's eye and coralberry, native to the west coast of India, Sri Lanka, Indochina, Malaysia, Indonesia and New Guinea. It is a prolific reproducer which has made it a successful invasive species in other locations in the tropics where it has been introduced as a garden ornamental."
    }
